 aria-pressed:border-paper/60 aria-pressed:bg-paper/10 transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-150 active:scale-[0.96]\\"><span class=\\"text-sm font-medium\\">Gemini CLI</span><span class=\\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] text-muted\\">terminal</span></button><button type=\\"button\\" aria-pressed=\\"false\\" class=\\"flex min-h-16 flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-xl border border-line-strong bg-ink px-4 py-2.5 text-left hover:border-paper/40 aria-pressed:border-paper/60 aria-pressed:bg-paper/10 transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-150 active:scale-[0.96]\\"><span class=\\"text-sm font-medium\\">oh-my-pi</span><span class=\\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] text-muted\\">config file</span></button><button type=\\"button\\" aria-pressed=\\"false\\" class=\\"flex min-h-16 flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-xl border border-line-strong bg-ink px-4 py-2.5 text-left hover:border-paper/40 aria-pressed:border-paper/60 aria-pressed:bg-paper/10 transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-150 active:scale-[0.96]\\"><span class=\\"text-sm font-medium\\">Generic</span><span class=\\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] text-muted\\">any MCP client</span></button></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\\"mt-4 text-sm text-pretty text-muted\\">Pick the app you use: one click or one line, then allow it in the browser window that opens.</p></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\\"advanced-title\\" class=\\"vignette-top rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-raised p-4 sm:p-8\\"><h2 id=\\"advanced-title\\" class=\\"text-lg leading-snug font-medium text-paper\\">Advanced: access key</h2><p class=\\"max-w-2xl text-pretty text-muted mt-1 mb-6 text-sm\\">For apps or scripts that cannot sign in through the browser, create a key and paste it in their configuration.</p><div class=\\"grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[22rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-10\\"><form aria-labelledby=\\"new-key\\" class=\\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-ink p-5\\"><h2 id=\\"new-key\\" class=\\"text-base leading-snug font-medium text-paper mb-4\\">New access key</h2><div class=\\"\\"><label for=\\"_R_j3t_\\" class=\\"text-sm font-medium\\">Name</label><div class=\\"rounded-lg border border-line-strong bg-ink text-paper caret-lime transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-paper/30 focus-within:border-paper/50 has-aria-invalid:border-amber-400/70 mt-1.5 flex h-11 items-center\\"><input id=\\"_R_j3t_\\" aria-describedby=\\"_R_j3t_-note\\" class=\\"h-full min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent px-3.5 text-paper placeholder:text-muted-light focus-visible:outline-none font-mono text-sm\\" placeholder=\\"claude-desktop, cursor, chatgpt…\\" required=\\"\\" autoComplete=\\"off\\" spellCheck=\\"false\\" value=\\"\\"/></div><p id=\\"_R_j3t_-note\\" class=\\"mt-1.5 min-h-5 text-sm text-muted\\">Only for you, to tell the keys apart.</p></div><div class=\\"\\"><label for=\\"_R_r3t_\\" class=\\"text-sm font-medium\\">Valid for (days)</label><div class=\\"rounded-lg border border-line-strong bg-ink text-paper caret-lime transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-paper/30 focus-within:border-paper/50 has-aria-invalid:border-amber-400/70 mt-1.5 flex h-11 items-center\\"><input id=\\"_R_r3t_\\" aria-describedby=\\"_R_r3t_-note\\" class=\\"h-full min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent px-3.5 text-paper placeholder:text-muted-light focus-visible:outline-none \\" type=\\"number\\" min=\\"1\\" max=\\"30\\" value=\\"30\\"/></div><p id=\\"_R_r3t_-note\\" class=\\"mt-1.5 min-h-5 text-sm text-muted\\">Up to 30 days.</p></div><button type=\\"submit\\" class=\\"relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium whitespace-nowrap pointer-coarse:after:absolute pointer-coarse:after:top-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:left-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:size-full pointer-coarse:after:min-h-11 pointer-coarse:after:min-w-11 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-x-1/2 pointer-coarse: