\\"max-w-2xl text-pretty text-muted mt-4\\"><p>Choose where held calls reach you besides this console. You answer wherever you see them first; the others update on their own.</p><p class=\\"mt-2 text-sm\\">Nothing is sent anywhere until you add a channel or pair a computer, and messages never include a call&#x27;s arguments: those stay on this computer.</p></div></header><div class=\\"flex flex-col gap-6\\"><section aria-labelledby=\\"elicit-title\\" class=\\"vignette-top rounded-xl border border-line-strong bg-ink-raised @container p-5 sm:p-6\\"><div class=\\"flex flex-wrap items-start gap-3\\"><span aria-hidden=\\"true\\" class=\\"grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line-strong text-muted\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"shrink-0 size-[1.1rem]\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.6\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M5 5.5h14a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 19 16.5h-7L7.5 20v-3.5H5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3.5 15V7A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5 5.5z\\"></path></svg></span><div class=\\"min-w-0 flex-1 basis-48\\"><h2 id=\\"elicit-title\\" class=\\"text-lg leading-snug font-medium text-paper\\">Ask in the AI app</h2><p class=\\"mt-0.5 max-w-2xl text-sm text-pretty text-muted\\">The app that made the call asks you itself, in its own window. It is off for every app until you turn it on here.</p></div></div><div class=\\"mt-5\\"><div class=\\"arrive flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 text-sm border-amber-400/40 bg-amber-400/5 \\"><div class=\\"min-w-0 flex-1 basis-56\\">Turn it on only for apps you answer by hand. An app with hooks or scripts that answer prompts on their own could approve its own calls. Destructive functions are never asked there, and Always allow this app is never offered there.</div></div><p class=\\"mt-4 text-sm text-muted\\">No app is connected yet. Connect one in Access and it shows up here.</p></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\\"devices-title\\" class=\\"vignette-top rounded-xl border border-line-strong bg-ink-raised @container p-5 sm:p-6\\"><div class=\\"flex flex-wrap items-start gap-3\\"><span aria-hidden=\\"true\\" class=\\"grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line-strong text-muted\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"shrink-0 size-[1.1rem]\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.6\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M4 5.5h16v13H4zM7.5 10l2.5 2-2.5 2M12.5 14.5h4\\"></path></svg></span><div class=\\"min-w-0 flex-1 basis-48\\"><h2 id=\\"devices-title\\" class=\\"text-lg leading-snug font-medium text-paper\\">Desktop popups</h2><p class=\\"mt-0.5 max-w-2xl text-sm text-pretty text-muted\\">A small helper on your computer shows a native notification for each held call; a click opens the call here.</p></div><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium whitespace-nowrap pointer-coarse:after:absolute pointer-coarse:after:top-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:left-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:size-full pointer-coarse:after:min-h-11 pointer-coarse:after:min-w-11 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-x-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-y-1/2 transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-150 active:scale-[0.96] bg-paper text-ink hover:bg-white focus-visible:bg-white disabled:opacity-60 h-9 px-4 text-sm\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"shrink-0 size-4\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.6\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"></path></svg>Pair this computer</button></div><div class=\\"mt-5\\"><p role=\\"alert\\" class=\\"mb-4 text-sm text-amber-400 empty:hidden\\"></p><p class=\\"text-sm text-muted\\">No computer is paired.</p></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\\"channels-title\\" class=\\"vignette-top rounded-xl border border-line-strong bg-ink-raised @container p-5 sm:p-6\\"><div class=\\"flex flex-wrap items-start gap-3\\"><span aria-hidden=\\"true\\" class=\\"grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line-strong text-muted\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"shrink-0 size-[1.1rem]\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.6\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M5 5.5h14a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 19 16.5h-7L7.5 20v-3.5H5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3.5 15V7A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5 5.5z\\"></path></svg></span><div class=\\"min-w-0 flex-1 basis-48\\"><h2 id=\\"channels-title\\" class=\\"text-lg leading-snug font-medium text-paper\\">Chat apps</h2><p class=\\"mt-0.5 max-w-2xl text-sm text-pretty text-muted\\">A bot sends each held call to you in a private message. With Discord, Slack and Telegram you answer with its buttons.</p></div><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium whitespace-nowrap pointer-coarse:after:absolute pointer-coarse:after:top-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:left-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:size-full pointer-coarse:after:min-h-11 pointer-coarse:after:min-w-11 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-x-1/2 pointer-coarse:after:-translate-y-1/2 transition-[background-color,border-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-150 active:scale-[0.96] bg-paper text-ink hover:bg-white focus-visible:bg-white disabled:opacity-60 h-9 px-4 text-sm\\"><svg aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" class=\\"shrink-0 size-4\\" fill=\\"none\\" stroke=\\"currentColor\\" stroke-width=\\"1.6\\" stroke-linecap=\\"round\\" stroke-linejoin=\\"round\\"><path d=\\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\\"></path></svg>Add channel</button></div><div class=\\"mt-5\\"><p class=\\"text-sm text-muted\\">No channel yet.</p></div></section></div></section></div></main><footer><div class=\\